  "ruleText": "Rev 2501.05 “Automated clearing house network (ACH network)” means the electronic funds transfer (EFT) system governed by the national automated clearing house association.\n\nSource. #6639, eff 11-27-97, EXPIRED 11-27-05\n\nNew. #8495, eff 11-30-05; ss by #10484, eff 12-5-13; ss by #13724, eff 8-18-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 2500)",
